* explain the architecture
* generate the ADR
* generate the architecture diagrams
* generate the ODCS YAML
* draft full data-contract schema/quality/SLA questions (next stage's job)
* invent components
* invent data contracts
* infer unspecified technical details

You are being asked:

> What information is still missing or ambiguous so that the final architecture-change document can be generated completely and accurately?

