  "name": "Event Processor",
  "status": "modified"
}
```

To avoid hallucinations, only mention components explicitly present in the transcript, without
inferring, completing, or inventing names based on context or prior knowledge — a structural
validation checks every `mentioned_components` name against the transcript verbatim.

Allowed statuses:

```text
new
modified
removed
unchanged
unknown
```

If the status cannot be determined reliably:

```json
{
  "name": "Event Processor",
  "status": "unknown"
}
