# `mentioned_data_contracts`

List every data contract identified in Phase 6, one entry per contract — this is the fixed list
the next stage will draft full ODCS-completeness questions against, so it must be complete and
grounded, never invented.

Each item must contain:

```json
{
  "name": "processed-event",
  "producer": "Event Processor",
  "consumer": "Analytics Service",
  "action": "forward-update"
}
```

Allowed `action` values:

```text
new
forward-update
break-change
unchanged
deprecated
