```

Use `forward-update`/`break-change` per Phase 7's compatibility criteria — never a generic
"modified". Use `"unknown"` for `producer`/`consumer`/`action` when the transcript doesn't
establish it — never guess, and generate the corresponding clarification question (Phase
7/Phase 8) instead.

